{ dg-modules "genietransput" }
{ Rosetta Code, task "Spinning rod animation/Text", ALGOL 68 solution spinning-rod-animation-text.alg.
  https://rosettacode.org/wiki/Spinning_rod_animation/Text#ALGOL_68
  The text of Rosetta Code is available under the GNU Free Documentation
  License 1.3 (see README.md).  The solution is unchanged in orig/spinning-rod-animation-text.a68;
  this copy was prepared for ga68 and converted to SUPPER stropping by
  tools/rosetta_prep.py. }
access Genie_Transput (
for i to 1 000 do { increase/decrease the TO value for a longer/shorter animation }
    to 2 000 000 do skip od; { adjust to change the spin rate }
    print( ( case 1 + i MOD 4 in "/", "-", "\", "|" esac, REPR 8 ) )
od
)
